WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.067
Grain is the main safeguard against incorrect reshaping.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:12.947
If the source has multiple transactions for Laptop in January, but the wide output has only one Laptop in January cell,

00:00:12.947 --> 00:00:16.877
then those transaction rows must be combined somehow.

00:00:16.877 --> 00:00:22.052
If revenue is the measure, adding the values together may be the correct rule.

00:00:22.052 --> 00:00:26.300
But the transaction level detail is no longer present in that cell.
